OL,3,AUganda's King Oyo buried amid calls for
OL,4,Aunity over his successor
OL,5,
OL,6,FUganda's King Oyo Nyimba Kabamba Iguru
OL,7,FRukidi IV, once the world's youngest
OL,8,Freigning monarch, was buried on
OL,9,FSaturday, days after a row broke out
OL,10,Fover who would succeed him.
OL,12,FOyo, 34, who had ruled the traditional
OL,13,Fkingdom of Tooro in western Uganda
OL,14,Fsince the age of three, died last month
OL,15,Fwhile undergoing cancer treatment in
OL,16,Fthe US.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
