OL,3,AUganda's King Oyo buried amid calls for
OL,4,Aunity over his successor
OL,5,
OL,6,FTooro is one of Uganda's traditional
OL,7,Fkingdoms. They were abolished in 1967
OL,8,Fbut restored in the 1990s under
OL,9,FPresident Museveni. Their monarchs are
OL,10,Frecognised as cultural leaders rather
OL,11,Fthan political rulers.
OL,13,FThousands of mourners lined the streets
OL,14,Fas the king's casket was transported to
OL,15,Fthe royal tombs in Fort Portal where a
OL,16,Fprivate ceremony took place.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
